<main><section class="page-space"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">THE FUTURE OF TRADING</div><h1 class="section-title">Why Trade Forex with Bytrox?</h1><p class="section-lead">With Bytrox Global, you gain access to institutional-grade liquidity, ultra-fast execution, and competitive pricing &mdash; empowering you to trade with confidence in the global currency arena.</p><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/forex-dollar.svg" alt=""></div><h3>24/5 Trading</h3><p>Access the global forex market 24 hours a day, 5 days a week, and trade across all major sessions.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/forex-trend.svg" alt=""></div><h3>High Liquidity</h3><p>Enjoy deep liquidity and consistently low spreads for optimal trading efficiency.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/forex-bars.svg" alt=""></div><h3>80+ Pairs</h3><p>Trade a wide range of currency pairs &mdash; majors, minors, and exotics &mdash; under fair, transparent conditions.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon-circle"><img src="${ctx}/images/forex-bolt.svg" alt=""></div><h3>Fast Execution</h3><p>Execute orders with exceptional speed and reliability, averaging under 50 milliseconds.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="narrow"><h2 class="section-title">Competitive Forex Spreads</h2><p class="section-lead">Access some of the lowest spreads available across all major, minor, and exotic currency pairs.</p><div style="overflow-x:auto"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Currency Pair</th><th class="highlight">Standard Account</th><th>Raw Account</th><th>Max Leverage</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="">EUR/USD</td><td class="">0.8 pips</td><td class="highlight">0.0 pips</td><td class="">1:500</td></tr><tr><td class="">GBP/USD</td><td class="">1.2 pips</td><td class="highlight">0.0 pips</td><td class="">1:500</td></tr><tr><td class="">USD/JPY</td><td class="">0.9 pips</td><td class="highlight">0.0 pips</td><td class="">1:500</td></tr><tr><td class="">AUD/USD</td><td class="">1.0 pips</td><td class="highlight">0.0 pips</td><td class="">1:500</td></tr><tr><td class="">USD/CAD</td><td class="">1.5 pips</td><td class="highlight">0.0 pips</td><td class="">1:500</td></tr></tbody></table></div><aside class="notice-box"><b>Important Notice:</b> The spreads and leverage ratios shown above are typical/indicative values for illustration purposes only. Actual spreads may vary based on market conditions, volatility, liquidity, and time of day. Spreads may widen significantly during major news events, market openings, or periods of low liquidity. Trading conditions are subject to change without notice.</aside><div class="center"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="${ctx}/${siteLang}/account-types">View All Account Types</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="narrow split"><div><h2 style="font-size:38px;margin:0">How Forex Trading Works</h2><p>Forex trading is the act of exchanging one currency for another at an agreed price. Each trade involves a currency pair, quoted to show the value of one currency against the other.</p><div class="step-list"><div class="step"><span class="step-num">1</span><div><h4>Choose Your Currency Pair</h4><p>Explore over 80 currency pairs, including popular majors like EUR/USD and GBP/USD.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">2</span><div><h4>Analyze the Market</h4><p>Apply both technical and fundamental analysis to identify trends, price movements, and key opportunities.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span class="step-num">3</span><div><h4>Execute Your Trade</h4><p>Enter buy or sell positions instantly through the MT5 platform with ultra-fast execution.</p></div></div></div></div><aside class="platform-card"><div><img src="${ctx}/images/forex-platform.svg" alt=""><h3>MT5 Trading Platform</h3><p>Professional trading tools at your fingertips</p></div></aside></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="container"><h2>Ready to Start Trading Forex?</h2><p>Join thousands of global traders who trust Bytrox for tight spreads, fast execution, and dedicated 24/5 support.</p><a class="btn btn-light cta-live" href="${ctx}/${siteLang}/account-types">Open Live Account</a><a class="btn cta-demo" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);color:#fff" href="#">Try free demo</a></div></section></main>
